# Syndication Mod files
#
# I have organized the mod files so that all the data associated with
# an item, for example, are together in a single file, to make it easier
# to create and debug specific gear, classes, characters, and stories

# Factions
#
# Each faction file contains all the associated data for the following
# tables as needed:
#
# Faction, Tag

Source_JSON/Factions.json

# Contact Classes
#
# Each contact class file contains all the associated data for the following
# tables as needed:
#
# ContactType, ContactService, Tag

Source_JSON/ContactTypes.json

# Contacts
#
# Each contact type file contains all the associated data for the following
# tables as needed
#
# ContactBackstory, ContactService, CosmeticGroup

Source_JSON/Contact_Dragons_CasinoOwner.json
Source_JSON/Contact_Dragons_SynBlade.json
Source_JSON/Contact_Dragons_SynFinance.json
Source_JSON/Contact_Ricksham_Railmaster.json
Source_JSON/Contact_Ricksham_SynBlade.json
Source_JSON/Contact_Yakuza_SynBlade.json
Source_JSON/Contact_Yakuza_SynBoss.json
Source_JSON/Contact_Yakuza_SynFinance.json

# Stories
#
# Each contact type file contains all the associated data for the following
# tables as needed:
#
# Legwork, StoryNode, StoryMatch, Block, BlockCondition, Dialog, DialogQuip, Tag, Talent
